# Member repos — independent git trees, not tracked by the Collective
# RaBbLE-Xperimental (active sandbox rablets), RaBbLE-Chrysalis (genesis archive) and RaBbLE-Pocket
# (device firmware) are version-tracked in their own git trees, so they are ignored here too
# (the wildcard below only covers names starting A, B, G, N, O, W, S).
RaBbLE-Grimoire/
RaBbLE-sCoRE/
RaBbLE-OS/
RaBbLE-World/
RaBbLE-NeBuLA/
RaBbLE-Aether/
RaBbLE-ScRiBbLE/
RaBbLE-BaBbLE/
RaBbLE-Chrysalis/
RaBbLE-Pocket/
RaBbLE-Xperimental/

# Catch-all for any future member added before .gitignore is updated
RaBbLE-[ABGNOW]*/
RaBbLE-S*/

